{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ACT","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"使徒行传","commonName":"使徒行传","title":"使徒行传","order":44,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"2300118029981baccc8075e9fe4f889da436dfc3635744300deccacc23d2139e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ACT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ACT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1005},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["选立执事"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，门徒的人数与日俱增。当中有些讲希腊话的犹太人埋怨讲希伯来话的犹太人，说对方在日常分配食物的事上怠慢了他们的寡妇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["于是，十二使徒召集所有的门徒，对他们说：“我们不应该忽略传上帝的道，去管理膳食。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["弟兄姊妹，请从你们中间选出七位声誉良好、充满圣灵和智慧的人来负责膳食，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["而我们要专心祈祷和传道。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大家一致同意，便选出充满信心和圣灵的司提凡，此外还有腓利、伯罗哥罗、尼迦挪、提门、巴米拿，以及曾信过犹太教、来自安提阿的外族人尼哥拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["大家将这七个人带到使徒面前。使徒为他们祷告并按手在他们身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝的道兴旺起来，耶路撒冷的门徒大大增多，连许多祭司也归信了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["司提凡被捕"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["司提凡满有恩典和能力，在百姓中间行了惊人的神迹奇事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但有些来自古利奈、亚历山大、基利迦和亚细亚、属于“自由人",{"noteId":11},"会堂”的犹太人联合起来与司提凡辩论。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们无法驳倒司提凡，因为他靠着智慧和圣灵说话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["于是，他们暗中唆使一些人诬告司提凡说：“我们听见他说亵渎摩西和上帝的话！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又煽动百姓、长老和律法教师抓住司提凡，把他押到公会。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他们还派人作伪证说：“司提凡常常讲侮辱圣地",{"noteId":12},"和律法的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我们听见他说那个拿撒勒人耶稣要毁坏圣殿，还要更改摩西传给我们的规矩。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["公会在座的人都盯着司提凡，只见他的面容好像天使的面容。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"“自由人”指的是原为奴隶，后来获得自由的人。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":9}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"“圣地”指“圣殿”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ACT/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ACT/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ACT/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}